[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_SADDLE]
Desert Office

[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_SADDLE_desc]
Trade contacts with Saddle Arabia have begun, and due to the distance, it is necessary to establish a desert office to better trade with Saddle Arabia.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_SADDLE]
沙漠办事处

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_SADDLE_desc]
与鞍拉伯的贸易接触已经开始，由于遥远的距离，我们有必要设立一个沙漠办事处，以便更好地与提雷克大王进行贸易往来。

